('hsk6_c13',12,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','千年雪莲','qiānnián xuělián','thousand year snow lotus','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 3}'),
('hsk4_c15',10,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','如果你打算参加聚会，请报名','rúguǒ nǐ dǎsuàn cānjiā jùhuì, qǐng bàomíng','if you plan to attend the party, please register','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 99}'),
('hsk4_c14',15,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','我保证我会按时完成工作','wǒ bǎozhèng wǒ huì ànshí wánchéng gōngzuò','I guarantee that I will finish the work on time','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 100}'),
('hsk4_c18',13,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','我已经看了这个电影三遍，我不想重新看','wo yǐjīng kànle zhège diànyǐng sān biàn, wǒ bùxiǎng chóngxīn kàn','I’ve already seen this movie three times, I don’t want to watch it again','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 101}'),
('hsk4_c09',21,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','他一直坚持节约钱，终于积累了够的钱买新手机','tā yīzhí jiānchí jiéyuē qián, zhōngyú jīlěile gòu de qián mǎi xīn shǒujī','he has always insisted on saving money and finally accumulated enough to buy a new smartphone.','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 103}'),
('hsk4_c17',18,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','由于一次吵，他们的友谊断了','yóuyú yīcì chǎo, tāmen de yǒuyì duànle','due to a quarrel, their friendship ended.','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 104}'),
('hsk4_c31',13,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','不管天气好坏，即使下雨，他每天都去跑步。','Bùguǎn tiānqì hǎo huài, jíshǐ xià yǔ, tā měitiān dōu qù pǎobù','Regardless of good or bad weather, even if it’s raining, he goes running every day','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 105}'),
('hsk4_c19',12,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','请你详细地说明这个问题','qǐng nǐ xiángxì de shuōmíng zhège wèntí','please explain this issue in detail','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 106}'),
('hsk4_c05',18,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','公司决定减少售货员的工作时间。','gōngsī juédìng jiǎnshǎo shòuhuòyuán de gōngzuò shíjiān','The company decided to reduce the working hours of salespeople','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 107}'),
('hsk4_c17',19,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','我们有许多共同的兴趣。','wǒmen yǒu xǔduō gòngtóng de xìngqù','we have many common interests','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 108}'),
('hsk4_c24',13,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','喝完后，请把瓶子扔进垃圾桶。','hē wán hòu, qǐng bǎ píngzi rēng jìn lājī tǒng','please throw the bottle into the trash can after you finish drinking it','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 109}'),
('hsk4_c03',15,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','我计划参观我想留学的学校','wǒ jìhuà cānguān wǒ xiǎng liúxué de xuéxiào','I plan to visit the school where I want to study abroad','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 110}'),
('hsk4_c17',20,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','我不小心把你的电话号码弄丢了，你能再给我一次吗？','wǒ bù xiǎoxīn bǎ nǐ de diànhuà hàomǎ nòng diū le, nǐ néng zài gěi wǒ yīcì ma','I accidentally lost your phone number, could you give it to me again','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 111}'),
('hsk4_c03',16,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','当我看到考试成绩时，我非常吃惊，因为我没有想到会得到这么高的成绩。','dāng wǒ kàn dào kǎoshì chéngjī shí, wǒ fēicháng chījīng, yīn wèi wǒ méiyǒu xiǎng dào huì dédào zhème gāo de chéngjī','when I saw the exam results, I was very surprised because I didn’t expect to get such a high score','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 112}'),
('hsk4_c27',17,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','我怀疑这个材料是假的。','wǒ huáiyí zhège cáiliào shì jiǎ de','I suspect this material is fake','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 113}'),
('hsk4_c19',13,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','你对这个问题有什么看法','nǐ duì zhège wèntí yǒu shéme kàn fǎ','what is your view on this issue','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 114}'),
('hsk4_c24',14,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','首先，你应该脱掉你的鞋子，然后进入房间。','shǒuxiān, nǐ yīnggāi tuō diào nǐ de xiézi, ránhòu jìnrù fángjiān','first of all, you should take off your shoes, then enter the room','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 115}'),
('hsk4_c11',22,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','这篇文章的这部分真的很有趣','zhè piān wénzhāng de zhè bùfen zhēn de hěn yǒuqù','this part of the article is really interesting','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 116}'),
('hsk4_c24',15,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','尽管很困，他还是主动在公交车上让出了座位给一个老人。','jǐnguǎn hěn kùn, tā háishì zhǔdòng zài gōngjiāo chē shàng ràng chūle zuòwèi gěi yīgè lǎorén','despite being tired, he actively gave up his seat on the bus for an elderly person','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 118}'),
('hsk4_c03',17,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','他后悔没有在不得不猜答案的时候学习','tā hòuhuǐ méiyǒu zài bùdébù cāi dá’àn de shíhòu xuéxí','he regretted not studying when he was forced to guess the answers','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 119}'),
('hsk4_c25',14,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','既然雨停止了，我们可以继续我们的网球比赛。','jìrán yǔ tíngzhǐ le, wǒmen kěyǐ jìxù wǒmen de wǎngqiú bǐsài','now that the rain has stopped, we can continue our tennis game','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 120}'),
('hsk4_c17',21,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','请告诉我你的电话号码的最后四个数字。','qǐng gàosù wǒ nǐ de diànhuà hàomǎ de zuìhòu sì gè shùzì','please tell me the last four digits of your phone number','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 121}'),
('hsk4_c16',11,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','他不但高，而且帅。','tā bùdàn gāo, érqiě shuài','he is not only tall but also handsome','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 122}'),
('hsk4_c05',19,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','去年，高级管理发生了改变','qùnián, gāojí guǎnlǐ fǎ shēng le gǎibiàn','last year, the high level managment changed','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 123}'),
