('hsk4_c11',28,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','当我读中文小说时，我身边总是有一本词典','dāng wǒ dú zhōngwén xiǎoshuō shí, wǒ shēnbiān zǒng shì yǒuyī běn cídiǎn','when I read Chinese novels, I always have a dictionary next to me','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 468}'),
('hsk4_c12',11,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','我需要向大使馆申请签证','Wǒ xūyào xiàng dàshǐguǎn shēnqǐng qiānzhèng','I need to apply for a visa at the embassy','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 469}'),
('hsk4_c12',12,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','合格的律师必须熟悉所有法律标准','hégé de lǜshī bìxū shúxī suǒyǒu fǎlǜ biāozhǔn','a qualified lawyer must be familiar with all legal standards','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 470}'),
('hsk4_c13',19,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','在过去的一年里，他的乒乓球能力逐渐超过了他的朋友','zài guòqù de yī nián lǐ, tā de pīngpāng qiú nénglì zhújiàn chāoguòle tā de péngyǒu','over the past year, his table tennis ability has gradually surpassed his friend''s','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 471}'),
