('hsk4_c13',21,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','他是因为打羽毛球而满身大汗','tā shì yīnwèi dǎ yǔmáoqiú ér mǎn shēn dà hàn','he is full of sweat from playing badminton','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 473}'),
('hsk4_c13',22,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','尽管他很努力，但还是输掉了比赛','jǐnguǎn tā hěn nǔlì, dàn háishì shū diàole bǐsài','despite his efforts he still lost the match','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 474}'),
('hsk4_c14',16,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','如果来得及，我将会提前做好所有准备','rúguǒ láidéjí, wǒ jiāng huì tíqián zuò hǎo suǒyǒu zhǔnbèi','if I have time, I will make all preparations in advance','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 475}'),
