('hsk4_c14',18,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','对那些大学生来说，他们往往关心自己的将来职业','duì nàxiē dàxuéshēng lái shuō, tāmen wǎngwǎng guānxīn zìjǐ de jiānglái zhíyè','for those college students, they often care about their future careers','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 478}'),
