('hsk4_c15',14,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','每当新年晚上到来时，我们家里总是很热闹','měi dāng xīnnián wǎnshàng dàolái shí, wǒmen jiālǐ zǒng shì hěn rènào','Whenever New Year''s Eve arrives, our home is always very lively','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 484}'),
