('hsk6_c21',14,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','他是我们门派的试炼弟子','tā shì wǒmen ménpài de shì liàn dìzǐ','he is a trial disciple of our sect','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 630}'),
('hsk6_c21',15,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','这个核心弟子是我们宗门的天才','zhège héxīn dìzǐ shì wǒmen zōng mén de tiāncái','this core disciple is the genius of our sect','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 631}'),
('hsk6_c21',16,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','这位师兄的实力相当平庸','zhè wèi shīxiōng de shílì xiāngdāng píngyōng','this senior brother''s strength is quite mediocre','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 632}'),
('hsk6_c21',17,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','他为我们门派做出了诸多功劳','tā wèi wǒmen ménpài zuò chūle zhūduō gōngláo','he has made many contributions to our sect','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 633}'),
('hsk6_c21',18,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','想要从门派那里获取资源，你需要有足够的贡献点','xiǎng yào cóng ménpài nàlǐ huòqǔ zīyuán, nǐ xūyào yǒu zúgòu de gòngxiàn diǎn','to obtain resources from the sect, you need to have enough contribution points','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 634}'),
('hsk6_c20',13,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','九尾狐已经活了九百多年','jiǔwěihú yǐjīng huóle jiǔbǎi duō nián','the nine tailed fox has lived for more than nine hundred years','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 635}'),
('hsk6_c20',14,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','当他到森林采集灵芝时，突然遇到了一条大蛇','dāng tā dào sēnlín cǎijí língzhī shí, túrán yùdàole yītiáo dàshé','when he went to the forest to collect lingzhi, he suddenly encountered a big snake','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 636}'),
('hsk6_c20',15,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','经过三百年的孵化，朱雀终于从巢里孵了出来','jīngguò sānbǎi nián de fūhuà, zhūquè zhōngyú cóng cháo lǐ fūle chūlái','after three hundred years of incubation, the vermilion bird finally hatched from the nest','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 637}'),
('hsk6_c20',16,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','他驯服了那只龙','tā xùnfúle nà zhǐ lóng','he tamed that dragon','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 638}'),
('hsk6_c20',17,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','龍和凤凰在天空中翱翔','lóng hé fènghuáng zài tiānkōng zhōng áoxiáng','the dragon and the phoenix soared in the sky','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 639}'),
('hsk6_c17',12,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','别放在心上','bié fàng zàixīn shàng','don''t take it to heart','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 640}'),
('hsk6_c17',13,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','蛤蟆想吃天鹅肉','hámá xiǎng chī tiān''é ròu','toad wants to eat swan meat','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 641}'),
