('hsk6_c22',12,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','你不知道吗？他是乾坤家族的公子','nǐ bù zhīdào ma? tā shì qiánkūn jiāzú de gōngzǐ','don''t you know? he is the young master of the Qiankun clan','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 647}'),
