('hsk4_c14',20,'example',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Example sentence for contextual practice.','这个过程很复杂，因此我们需要更多的时间来完成','zhège guòchéng hěn fùzá, yīncǐ wǒmen xūyào gèng duō de shíjiān lái wánchéng','this process is complex, thus we need more time to complete it','{"source": "example.db", "ui": "example_card", "sentence_id": 649}'),
